# Storybook docs

When adding or editing a component, MDX, stories, ArgTypes, or `docs-locale.ts`, follow `.cursor/skills/storybook-docs/SKILL.md`.

Match `Button.mdx` / `TextInput.mdx` / `TimeAgo.mdx`: French sections, one Canvas per capability, Accessibilité + À faire / À éviter, explicit ArgTypes, `componentSource` from `d-ui`. Autodocs tags are not enough.
